Earthworm components bundled in scbinder
=======================================

The files under core/ and ewlib/ are carried over verbatim from Earthworm
(https://gitlab.com/seismic-software/earthworm), originally from
src/seismic_processing/binder_ew/ and src/libsrc/util/ + include/. They
retain their original Earthworm copyright and are distributed under the
MIT license reproduced below, which must accompany any copy or
substantial portion of them. See NOTICE for the exact file list.

